encoding  utf-8
survey Waterwheel

#Waterwheel Swallet, Charterhouse
#Data from Willie Stanton's Survey Book 2 pp80 et seq
#In all cases bearings in the original are in degrees and minutes
#These are converted here to decimal degrees
#Typed in by Graham Mullan June 2010

input W1/W1.th
input W2/W2.th
equate 87@W1 87@W2

input W3/W3.th
equate 90@W2 90@W3

input W4/W4.th
equate 97@W3 97@W4

input W5/W5.th
equate 107@W4 107@W5

input W6/W6.th
equate 115@W5 115@W6

input W7/W7.th
equate 129@W6 129@W7

input W8/W8.th
equate 136@W7 136@W8

input W9/W9.th
equate 154@W8 154@W9

input W10/W10.th
equate 161@W9 161@W10

endsurvey

